  %% Client to Gateway
  WebStudent & WebGuardian & WebTutor & WebAdmin --> Nginx
  Nginx --> AuthGuard --> RateLimiter --> CoreApi

  %% Core API Internal Dependencies
  CoreApi --> PostgresDB
  CoreApi --> RedisQueue
  CoreApi --> SocketGateway

  %% Realtime flows
  WebStudent & WebTutor <--> LiveKit
  LMSMod --> LiveKit
  SocketGateway <--> RedisQueue

  %% Outbox & External Providers
  PostgresDB -.-> OutboxWorker
  OutboxWorker --> SMSProvider
  OutboxWorker --> SMTPMail
  PayMod <--> SSLCommerz & bKash
  TrustMod & TutorMod --> PrivateStorage
